      "date": "2026-08-02",
      "note": "Phase 6: batch-level Data source metadata uses the existing schema only: required code and name, plus optional description. Do not expand Data source metadata in this phase.",
      "adr_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-08-02",
      "note": "Phase 6: Data source code is the stable identity. If an entered code already exists, use its stored name and description as read-only metadata and reject conflicting submitted metadata rather than silently ignoring or updating it.",
      "adr_candidate": false
    }
  ],
